      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "She found the same opening twice. That is enough to answer the question. We ate together afterward; I would rather remember what she showed me than spend the evening defending my pride.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
