      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "For us, movement carries meaning. How someone answers pressure, keeps balance or chooses to yield can say a great deal. It takes attention, though. One awkward step is no excuse to decide you know a stranger.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
